{"channelId":"UCe5iGasQE-Ss10LAYk3PkZw","row":["Surry Animal Rescue",10,"Surry Animal Rescue is a NC certified non-profit volunteer organization.  We operate solely on donations from adoptions and other resources.  We rescue animals from abandonment, abuse, neglect, and euthanasia by providing medical care and foster home placement until loving, permanent homes can be found.\n\nOur mission is to not only help animals in need, but to educate people on properly taking care of their animals. To ensure that animal welfare is our number one priority. We will do everything possible to make sure animals are put in loving foster homes, get the proper vet care they need, and find forever homes to approved adopters.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe5iGasQE-Ss10LAYk3PkZw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe5iGasQE-Ss10LAYk3PkZw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:49.397Z","channelId":"UCe5iGasQE-Ss10LAYk3PkZw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"fcb1e2ef2e383012533f0e664f8aecbe2d2d25680d9c58b601e3370f52605917","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"5e6163747f7ed41654f4a9c0bf8507003c3019dd1c2617fdc205163d1f20aaab"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe5iGasQE-Ss10LAYk3PkZw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":10,"raw":"10 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe5iGasQE-Ss10LAYk3PkZw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:49.397Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe5iGasQE-Ss10LAYk3PkZw"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["animal rescue"],"role":"orga